  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>RWA value remains network-concentrated:</strong> the top chains continue to capture the majority of distributed issuance and often set near-term market direction. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/ecosystems/2026-11-27-ai-math-breakthroughs-revive-bitcoin-security-fears-but-practical-threat-remains-unproven-k33-447549\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AI math breakthroughs revive Bitcoin security fears, but practical threat remains unproven: K33</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Institutional expansion is likely staged:</strong> large-scale adoption typically lands on proven networks first, then broadens as compliance, interoperability, and liquidity deepen. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOY1dwQ1l4Mzh4dWhuLWdDcEJicjhnOEZuOGdIa1RYYUtkSmwyT0hiM2p2VXI2aWUwcGhhaEdsN1JBdkJmVEc3TzAwWTlEQnkyOW5NRGZqTkdxakhydHQtdnBlV1RSSWJ0VVl0NHhKSUJObzExOFh4dVhVdW8ySU5JWFN1anNSSnhXTHRIYjhidEZUMGdNOVRsakJGNlFQSDBYQTFnNU5RTGhRZWZsSVBmNw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Injective asks SEC to expand tokenized stock rules beyond liquidity pools</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Custody and issuance integrations are moving rankings first:</strong> Chains that win custody and issuance integrations usually pull distributed value share before the broader RWA market total catches up. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/tech/2026/11/26/standard-chartered-s-zodia-custody-suffers-data-breach-exposing-client-information\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Standard Chartered&#x27;s Zodia Custody suffers data breach, exposing client information</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Co